# Vengeful Townsfolk (3/3): "Whenever one or more other creatures you control die, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature."
# Bot1 controls the Townsfolk and two Ornithopters, Bot2 one Ornithopter. Bot2's Pyroclasm (2 damage to each creature) kills the three
# Ornithopters at once (the Townsfolk survives): one batch, so exactly one counter (CR 603.2c), and Bot2's own dying creature adds none.

